        "dose": "0.5uM"
      }
    ],
    "culture_other_conditions": "William E medium,2%B27withoutVA,1%PS,1%FBS;1e5cells/cm2;7–10days beforepassage1:2,daily medium change;three donor liver entries(age30male,67female,55male,allHCC);figure expression n4,independence/donor mapping not explained."
  },
  "harms_and_limits": [
    "No dedicated Apcin-only healthy-animal toxicity group; no dose-response,PK,systemic toxicity or longer-term tissue-regeneration/genome-integrity evaluation.",
    "Three of seven Apcin+CCl4 mice appear not to survive to the last displayed point,inferred from the plot; this is residual model mortality and cannot be attributed to drug toxicity.",
    "Pretreatment before a planned toxic insult does not establish efficacy after established liver failure.",
    "CCl4 model is not an MVA/BUB1B-deficient model and does not test benefit in COVID-19 infection; authors explicitly call COVID-19 efficacy theoretical.",
    "Survival timing mismatch and absent significance statistic limit quantitative interpretation.",
    "Methods assigned n7/group for tissue,but figure uses n3 expression/histology and n4 biochemistry; sample selection and technical-versus-biological units not reconciled.",
    "No drug-arm restoration of liver identity/function-gene expression is demonstrated despite broad discussion language."
  ],
